WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.990
<i>Everyone is searching for a new world</i>

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:12.090
<i>to attain that overflowing dream.</i>

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:17.670
<i>They all jump over the horizon,</i>

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:26.440
<i>regardless of what lies beyond.</i>

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.180
<i>We've run,</i>

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.650
<i>we've dived into hope,</i>

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.520
<i>and forgotten only courage.</i>

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:44.260
<i>And we've been swept away by the crowd</i>

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:48.920
<i>only to lose something dear to us.</i>

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.600
<i>I smile with a twisted face,</i>

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:01.270
<i>and it was the best smile I could put on.</i>

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.650
<i>The inside of my mask overflowed with tears</i>

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:12.290
<i>so I covered my wet mask
with yet another mask.</i>

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:17.190
<i>I continue to walk through
the flat battleground,</i>

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>and I struggle, unable to warp.</i>

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:32.540
<i>The dream waits quietly on a cape far away.</i>

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.280
<i>Even if I fumble around clumsily,</i>

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:42.010
<i>I'm sure I'll still be
able to make it there.</i>

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:23.540
"Overture"

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.060
That was excellent!

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:38.770
There's still time until the concert,

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:39.970
what will you do?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.660
-Let me see the set list.
-Oh, right...

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:48.200
I'd like you to prepare candles.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.870
Pass them out to all attendants.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.400
The lights will fall during this piece

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.210
and the thousands of candles will be lit.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.670
What a romantic performance!

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:00.600
It's perfect for something as
hypocritical as a charity concert.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:11.220
Yes?

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.660
Merry Christmas, Rutherford.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:18.060
In five hours, your life will end.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:29.400
"Very shortly, an even more dangerous
Hunter will appear before you.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.540
To exterminate the Blade Children..."

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:47.630
"Your skills are at best an
imitation of your brother's.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:51.230
You don't even begin to
compare to the original.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.030
If you're the younger brother
of Kiyotaka Narumi...

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.620
...then aim high!"

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:08.710
<i>They're the only clues I have...</i>

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.880
I thought I would find you here!

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.660
Even on Christmas Eve, you have
the same gloomy face as ever!

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.790
What do you want? Make it quick.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.190
Ta-dah!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.330
For me?

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.890
No!

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:32.740
A Hunter?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:35.170
So they finally started
making their moves...

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.200
Tell us everything from the beginning.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.810
Merry Christmas, Rutherford.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:47.850
In five hours, your life will end.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.190
That's an elaborate Christmas present.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.190
Did you spend all night thinking it up?

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.260
Don't take it so hard.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:55.860
You're the top prey, after all.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:00.370
Then stuff me and put me
above a fireplace.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:02.900
I can't use a bomb for that...

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.040
Is that what you want to hear?

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.070
Alright. It IS Christmas,
so I'll tell you.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.210
I won't use a bomb.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.210
The death of Eyes Rutherford
will also be a message of death

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.650
to the Blade Children...

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.480
Playtime is over.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.980
A declaration of war?!
Talk about polite!

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.560
It might be a bomb...

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.660
Never! That would be
too simple to fall for!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.730
That's exactly why!

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:33.770
<i>We would discount it as a possibility
because it's so simple.</i>

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.370
He might use that to his advantage!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:37.540
There will be no bomb.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.970
The time he indicated is
the start of the concert.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:45.240
It wouldn't be hard
to find a bomb by then...

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.410
Naturally he would realize that.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:51.520
But there's no guarantee
he'll do what he said!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.350
That's what bothers me!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.190
He could easily get rid of you
any number of ways!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.220
So why did he go out of his
way to inform us?

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:02.360
What does he have to gain by warning us?

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:05.200
He must be really
confident of himself...

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:09.430
He dares to warn us and give
us plenty of time to react...

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.870
So isn't he taunting us
and basically telling us

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:15.540
that resistance is pointless?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:19.710
And if it's also a message
to the Blade Children,

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.110
the Hunter will make it
look like an accidental death.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.980
A display of power!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.420
Even with the crowd watching,

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:28.720
he can still kill you under
the guise of an accident.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:29.890
If he really wanted to,

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.330
killing a Blade Child would
be like a walk in the park!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.660
The bastard must think
he's a real hot shot!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.160
I'll make him pay!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.860
You're not to do anything.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.900
I will take care of this myself.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.440
What are you talking about?!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:49.510
He's declared war
on all Blade Children!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.870
Rio still can't move by herself.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.720
Should anything happen to me...

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.740
...take her with you and hide.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.580
Rutherford...

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.560
Four hours left, Rutherford.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.170
The Hunter?

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:17.230
Abandon any notions of this
being a declaration of war.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:23.300
Our fight is not nearly as clean...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.980
<i>Eyes-kun!</i>

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:29.070
Remember, you still
owe me a Christmas melon.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.840
It's a Christmas present.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.400
<i>From Hiyono-san?</i>

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:55.070
If you're done here, then get lost.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.540
I'm not done yet.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.130
Where is my brother?

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.610
No idea.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.620
Then what's a Hunter?

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.520
How the hell do you know about that?!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.520
Is this Hunter after my brother too?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:10.860
I don't have to answer that!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.390
Get the hell out!

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:13.860
Just calm down.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.200
I realize you're worked up because
your friend is being targeted.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.230
You listened in on our conversation,
didn't you?!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.870
<i>Just as Kosuke-kun says,</i>

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.670
<i>we don't know where
Kiyotaka-sama is, either.</i>

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.970
We really don't.

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.920
Why don't you cancel the concert?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.920
He'd never agree to that.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:45.720
That's exactly what
the enemy would want.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:49.390
So it's okay to put the lives
of the audience at risk too?

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:53.700
We're about to enter territory
not meant for you.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.030
I'm telling you this nicely.

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:59.270
If you're saying you have no
intention of telling me anything,

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:01.330
then I'll subdue this Hunter and...

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:05.970
"Kill before being killed!"
That's how every day is for us!

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.280
Sonobe was also a Hunter...

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.320
As was Imazato.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.850
That may be the easiest way
for you to understand.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.520
If you're saying there's
a reason for what you're doing,

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.420
then I have my own reason.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.090
Do as you wish!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.970
<i>We need Little Narumi's abilities...</i>

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.380
Merry Christmas Eve!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.040
I'm here to deliver your Christmas cake!

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:43.650
I don't remember ordering one...

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.340
<i>It's from Hiyono-chan!</i>

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.220
It looks like we'll get
the candles just in time!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:55.950
Have a look over this, please!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.300
What are you doing here?!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:08.740
Just thought you might
be lonely by yourself...

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.090
There are no signs of the
lights being tampered with.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.100
The floor is made of resin panels.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.200
He can't electrocute you.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.970
How's the piano?

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:37.970
I've checked, there are no problems.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.310
I see...

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.970
Can you think of any
other possibilities?

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.940
What about underground?

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.140
The gas pipes.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.650
To blow up the entire place?!

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:50.250
Out of the question...

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:54.750
It would be immediately obvious to
the police it wasn't an accident.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.720
The reason for making it
look like an accident

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:00.520
is to avoid as much police
intervention as possible.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.830
Find anything?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.700
Two hours left.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:13.170
It seems I have two hours left.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.030
Damn it!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.310
There's always the possibility
of poisoning his food.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.650
You ate some?!

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.120
The effects of drugs vary
from person to person.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.850
It would be difficult to determine
a specific time until death...

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.220
<i>...but it is a possibility.</i>

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:41.260
Geez, how did I get
talked into this?!

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.900
Well, I leave the tests in your hands.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.470
By the way...

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.370
Is that girl with you?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.640
No, but I heard too.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.580
That you committed a heinous
crime despite being an officer...

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.780
Oh no! I've been threatened!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:12:00.220
I'm going to be blackmailed
for the rest of my life!

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:00.680
Maybe...

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:06.890
The light snow,
fuwa fuwa fuwa ri

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:12.060
became a white-winged angel

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:14.130
What a weird song.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.330
Say, I haven't heard anything,

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.140
but have you made any plans with Ayumu?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:18.940
No!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.930
<i>Narumi-san offered to deliver
my Christmas presents for me!</i>

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.820
You're unpleasant to listen to.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:34.790
How about calming down?

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:37.160
No matter how you look at it,

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:39.390
there's just no way
to set a trap on the stage!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:40.760
<i>Maybe it really is poison?</i>

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.260
What's a Hunter?

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.800
Why are they trying to kill you?

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:44.930
You keep quiet.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.600
What are the Blade Children?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.200
I said shut up!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.360
Answer me! Why are you...

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.110
I'll tell you!

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.470
It's because we're
missing one of these!

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.770
Asazuki...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:16.560
What the hell is Rio expecting from him?!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:19.560
There's no way he can
save the Blade Children!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.000
He's just an eyesore!

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.470
You're expecting something
from him as well.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.630
Or else you wouldn't
have brought him here.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.600
This is an excellent opportunity
to ascertain his skill.

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:34.580
It's because we're
missing one of these!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.650
Our fight is not nearly as clean...

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:40.290
<i>The Blade Children...</i>

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.650
<i>Exactly what kind of burden
are they carrying?</i>

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:47.920
"Wataya"

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.030
Well?!

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.620
Apparently no drugs were found.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:00.310
But that doesn't change this situation.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.870
You really should cancel the concert.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.400
I will not.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.120
Thirty minutes.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.120
You won't get away with this!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.140
Incidentally, I don't use poison.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.830
We're being listened in on!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.020
He knows everything we've been doing!

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:25.820
Here it is!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.690
Damn it!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.910
This thing doesn't have
a big broadcast range!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:37.370
The bastard's somewhere nearby!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.050
Get ready for stand-by, please!

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:51.040
Cancel it, Rutherford!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.560
This is no time to be stubborn!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.760
Step aside.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.760
Don't make me stop you!

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:01.700
It's all over once we
turn our back to fate.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.800
You might die, you know!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.300
You would do the same as I.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:06.270
Rutherford!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:09.040
-Let him go.
-What?!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:24.520
What'd you bring us out here for?

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:27.230
There might be other listening devices.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:31.430
We can't discuss catching
the Hunter in there.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.900
You know what he has in store?!

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:34.900
Yeah...

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.000
Anyway, we're really short on time.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.900
Rutherford. Delay the performance
by 5 minutes.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.270
It's short enough a delay
that he won't try to escape.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:46.170
We're going to incapacitate the
Hunter in those five minutes!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.250
What is the murder method of choice?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.410
The answer is a sniper attack!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.190
On what basis?!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.730
I'll explain it once we've
subdued the Hunter!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.600
Just so you know, if Eyes gets killed,

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.570
I'm gonna put an end to you too!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.870
Right, then the lights come down and...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.040
I'm starting the performance
two minutes early.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.650
And I'd like to start
with this piece instead.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.450
Rearrange the order for me.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:28.110
-But this is so sudden...
-Take care of it.

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:54.870
I told him to delay it!

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.840
What the hell is he doing?!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.680
All ready to die, huh?

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:05.860
Damn it!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.190
Where's the Hunter aiming from?!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:11.800
Considering the field of
vision and ease of escape...

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.460
...by the front-right light,
facing the stage!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.070
There he is!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.210
I'll distract him.
You come around from behind!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:24.140
Got it!

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.620
This is the end, Rutherford...

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:16.020
Damn!

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.130
Don't shoot!

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.070
Drop the gun!

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:44.650
Come back here!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.600
Dammit!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.840
Purposely making himself a target...

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:00.510
What is he thinking?!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.710
<i>He probably wanted to
make the Hunter shoot...</i>

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:05.180
As if to say,
"I won't let things go your way..."

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:06.380
He's insane!

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:12.180
Even though the thousands of
candle flames did warp the cold air,

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.890
it was still reckless!

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:16.290
Reckless?

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:19.620
We've been driven
into the corner since birth.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:23.930
The word "reckless"
has no meaning to us...

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:35.710
By the way, how did you know it
was going to be a sniper attack?

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:37.540
That listening device.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.610
A pro would have used
something much more elaborate...

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:44.750
The one you found was only
meant for you to see...

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.390
The fact that he went out of his way
to tell you he was listening

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.490
is proof of that...

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:52.690
Once I realized that,
the answer came to me.

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:56.760
It was all a feint
to hide a simple attack.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:59.500
Because you were being so
cautious about the Hunter,

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:01.070
you overestimated him

00:20:01.070 --> 00:20:03.970
and lost your abilities of
calm judgment and perception...

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:08.270
As a result, you were lured
into the incorrect theory

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.540
that he would fake
an accidental death...

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:15.350
Check for yourself, there should
be another listening device set...

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:19.020
One that's much more elaborate
and not easily found.

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:22.850
It was because you fell into that trap

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.480
that the killer was able
to place himself out so calmly.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.290
It was all a ruse...

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:34.160
A ruse to hide a simple,
yet effective sniper attack.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:36.630
Hello?

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.740
-Where in the world are you?!
-Jingle bells, jingle bells...

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.810
-Come home right this minute!
-Christmas! Yay!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.640
Yeah, alright. I'll be home soon.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.670
Bye.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:54.750
<i>Does that mean he intended to save
Rutherford from the very start?</i>

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:11.600
<i>A sweet scent washes into my throat</i>

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:18.300
<i>and my feelings continuously overflow...</i>

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:36.460
<i>Don't look at me with that same gaze</i>

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:42.100
<i>that's like you're following a soccer ball.</i>

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:48.010
<i>I've already grown used to
my third year at the office,</i>

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:54.580
<i>but did I lose something instead?</i>

00:21:54.580 --> 00:22:00.320
<i>Those days long ago when we
would talk about anything...</i>

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:05.520
<i>We're finally old enough now</i>

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:11.360
<i>to have those slightly awkward
discussions about love.</i>

00:22:11.360 --> 00:22:22.970
<i>A single day seems so long,
but a whole year ends so quickly.</i>

00:22:22.970 --> 00:22:28.750
<i>A whole year seems so short,</i>

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:35.050
<i>but how well will I be able
to live the rest of my life?</i>

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:40.790
Santa Hiyono's Postcard Corner!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:43.060
<i>What did you ask for?</i>

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:46.290
"Please make it snow on Christmas Day."

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:48.190
"20 inches would be nice!"

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:49.290
I can't do that!

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:52.030
"Please make it always
be winter vacation."

00:22:52.030 --> 00:22:52.970
I can't do that!

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.730
"I want love. Please give me love."

00:22:55.730 --> 00:22:58.470
"From Officer Suemaru Wataya"...

00:22:58.470 --> 00:22:59.540
Eh?!

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:01.870
On the next Spiral:
Bond of Reasoning...

00:23:01.870 --> 00:23:03.840
Like a Sweet Aroma Haze

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:06.080
That's all for today's
Santa Hiyono's Playhouse!

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.070
Merry Reindeer!
